; printer_notes = Don't remove the following keywords! These keywords are used in the compatible printer condition of the print and filament profiles.\nPRINTER_VENDOR_RAISE3D\nPRINTER_MODEL_PRO2PLUS_HS\nPRINTER_VARIANT_DUAL\nEXPERIMENTAL\nNot production-ready. Hyper Speed / Klipper Pro2 Plus dual electronic-lift heads.\nLeft-only from LeftonlyExtruder.gcode. Right-only (T1 home + same X20 Y0 wipe) from RightonlyExtruder.gcode. Dual start, standby tool-change, and dual end from MulticolorRaise3d.gcode. Single-tool end from the matching ideaMaker file (no unused-tool M104/M221). XY nozzle offset is firmware (factory ~25 mm X) — slicer offset is 0 so it is not applied twice. PrusaSlicer 2.9.6 has no per-tool printable area; the bed texture marks the leftmost 25 mm as T1 keep-out. Default wipe tower is X50 Y140 (past that band; drag on the plater). Stage 6-7 physical tests still required.
